# Raw LLVM profile data from `cargo llvm-cov`.
#
# Most of it lands under `target/llvm-cov-target/` and is already ignored by
# the root rule. These escape it: several suites spawn a child process that
# changes its working directory, and the instrumented child writes its profile
# beside wherever it happens to be — which is a source directory. They are
# machine-local measurement scratch, never review material.
*.profraw
